  guideTitle: "Loveseat vs Sofa: How Many Seats Does Your Room Need",
  metaTitle: "Loveseat vs Sofa: Which Fits Your Room",
  metaDescription: "Compare loveseats and sofas by real seat counts, lying-down length and layout, plus when two loveseats or a loveseat with chairs beats one sofa.",
  heroImage: "/images/articles/loveseat-sofa-hero.webp",
